},"0001467373-26-000049":{"c":"ACN","form":"10-K","filed":"2026-10-16"},"0001467373-24-000352":{"c":"ACN","form":"10-Q","filed":"2024-12-19"},"0001467373-25-000100":{"c":"ACN","form":"10-Q","filed":"2025-03-20"},"0001467373-25-000169":{"c":"ACN","form":"10-Q","filed":"2025-06-20"},"0001467373-25-000222":{"c":"ACN","form":"10-Q","filed":"2025-12-18"},"0001467373-26-000014":{"c":"ACN","form":"10-Q","filed":"2026-03-19"},"0001467373-26-000032":{"c":"ACN","form":"10-Q","filed":"2026-06-18"}},"finsights":{"ACN":[{"topic":"fcf","text":"Free cash flow was $11.6 billion in FY2026: operating cash flow of $12.4 billion less capital spending of $743 million (computed from two filed figures). That is 15.7% of revenue. In FY2021 it was $8.4 billion.","cites":["ACN.ocf.2026","ACN.capex.2026","ACN.revenue.2026","ACN.ocf.2021","ACN.capex.2021"]},{"topic":"sbc","text":"Stock-based compensation was $2.1 billion in FY2026, 2.8% of revenue, against 2.7% in FY2021.","cites":["ACN.sbc.2026","ACN.revenue.2026","ACN.sbc.2021","ACN.revenue.2021"]},{"topic":"returns","text":"In FY2026 the company paid $7.5 billion to repurchase its own shares and $4 billion in dividends: $11.5 billion together (computed from two filed figures).","cites":["ACN.buybacks.2026","ACN.dividends.2026"]},{"topic":"quarter","text":"In the three months ended 2026-08-31 revenue was $18.7 billion, up 6.2% from $17.6 billion in the three months ended 2025-08-31.","cites":["ACN.d.revenue.2026-06-01.2026-08-31","ACN.d.revenue.2025-06-01.2025-08-31"]},{"topic":"ttm","text":"Over the four quarters to 2026-08-31 revenue added up to $74.2 billion (computed from four filed figures), operating income to $11.4 billion and net income to $8.4 billion.","cites":["ACN.d.revenue.2025-09-01.2025-11-30","ACN.d.revenue.2025-12-01.2026-02-28","ACN.d.revenue.2026-03-01.2026-05-31","ACN.d.revenue.2026-06-01.2026-08-31","ACN.d.opinc.2025-09-01.2025-11-30","ACN.d.opinc.2025-12-01.2026-02-28","ACN.d.opinc.2026-03-01.2026-05-31","ACN.d.opinc.2026-06-01.2026-08-31","ACN.d.netinc.2025-09-01.2025-11-30","ACN.d.netinc.2025-12-01.2026-02-28","ACN.d.netinc.2026-03-01.2026-05-31","ACN.d.netinc.2026-06-01.2026-08-31"]},{"topic":"ttm","text":"Free cash flow over the same four quarters was $11.6 billion: operating cash flow of $12.4 billion less capital spending of $743 million (computed from eight filed figures).","cites":["ACN.d.ocf.2025-09-01.2025-11-30","ACN.d.ocf.2025-09-01.2026-02-28","ACN.d.ocf.2025-09-01.2026-05-31","ACN.d.ocf.2025-09-01.2026-08-31","ACN.d.capex.2025-09-01.2025-11-30","ACN.d.capex.2025-09-01.2026-02-28","ACN.d.capex.2025-09-01.2026-05-31","ACN.d.capex.2025-09-01.2026-08-31"]},{"topic":"backlog","text":"Remaining performance obligations - revenue under contract that was not yet recognised - were $37 billion at the end of FY2026, against $34 billion a year earlier. That is 49.9% of FY2026 revenue (computed from two filed figures).","cites":["ACN.rpo.2026","ACN.rpo.2025","ACN.revenue.2026"]},{"topic":"backlog","text":"Deferred revenue was $6.3 billion at the end of FY2026 (tagged DeferredRevenueCurrent), against $6.1 billion a year earlier.","cites":["ACN.deferred.2026","ACN.deferred.2025"]},{"topic":"people","text":"The latest annual report gives the workforce as 814,000 in its own words. FY2026 revenue works out to about $91,000 for each (computed from one filed figure and the number in that sentence).","cites":["ACN.q.employees","ACN.revenue.2026"]},{"topic":"debt","text":"At the end of FY2026 the balance sheet carried $12.8 billion in cash and cash equivalents and $6.3 million in short-term investments, and $10.1 billion of debt as tagged (LongTermDebtAndCapitalLeaseObligations + DebtCurrent). Cash and short-term investments exceeded that debt by $2.7 billion (computed from four filed figures).","cites":["ACN.cash.2026","ACN.sti.2026","ACN.debtLong.2026","ACN.debtCurrent.2026"]}]},"fin":{"ACN":{}},"quotes":{"ACN.q.employees":{"c":"ACN","kind":"employees","n":814000,"quote":"As of August 31, 2026, we employed approximately 814,000 people.","source":"ACN-0001467373-26-000049","section":"Item 1. Business","date":"2026-10-16","proof":"3781e07a03aa11cb7a63ff9367a4f0cc833c17ecae9108cf24d1d5114d9aefab"}}}